<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-006" chapter-id="c-nanshi-006-liang-close-family" source-id="s-nanshi006-liang-close-family">
  <p id="c-nanshi-006-liang-close-family:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">　　梁高祖武皇帝諱<persName id="c-nanshi-006-liang-close-family:p001:m0009" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AA">衍</persName>，字叔達，小字練兒，南蘭陵中都里人，姓蕭氏，與齊同承淮陰令整。整生皇高祖轄，位濟陰太守。轄生皇曾祖副子，位州治中從事。副子生皇祖<persName id="c-nanshi-006-liang-close-family:p001:m0074" ref="cav_2xc_9bq">道賜</persName>，位南台治書侍御史。道賜生皇考，諱<persName id="c-nanshi-006-liang-close-family:p001:m0093" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_A">順之</persName>，字文緯，于齊高帝為始族弟。</p>
</text>
